:: Doren Loft
<<effects>>
You tell Doren about the loft at the orphanage.
<br><br>
<<He>> nods, and smiles. "I see. Let's set up a reading nook! I'll get the books. We got lots of them from the book drive." <<He>> taps <<his>> chin as <<he>> thinks. "But setting it up is probably gonna cost us. <<printmoney 250000>>. What do you say?"
<br><br>
<<if $money gte 250000>>
	<<link [[Set up reading nook (£2500 3:00)|Doren Loft 2]]>><<set $phase to 1>><<money -250000 "orphanageUpgrades">><<pass 180>><</link>>
<<else>>
